<%# locals: (content:, title: "Dinner Time", board: false) %>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrf_token %>">
<meta name="theme-color" content="<%= board ? "#ffffff" : "#ececea" %>">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Dinner Time">
<title><%= title == app_title ? title : "#{title} · #{app_title}" %></title>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/barlow-sc-700.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/barlow-sc-500.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css">
</head>
<body class="<%= board ? "board-page" : "" %>">
<!--
THESIS: The whole dinner is one departure board: time, what, where, status, read from a metre away. It refuses the card-list-with-checkboxes every timer and recipe app ships.
OWN-WORLD: A kitchen timer: white enamel board, black tabular numerals, grey captions, one red lamp for NOW and LATE, and platform-style boxes for Oven 1, Oven 2 and Hob. One grotesk (Barlow Semi Condensed) at four fixed sizes. One light scheme day and night; around the board, a light grey ground with ruled forms. Chosen by Jamie from three finishes on 2026-09-19.
STORY: The cook glances, finds the one lit row, does that thing, taps its lamp; the board dims it and lights the next. Late is a word and a lamp, never an alarm.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Cook page. A sticky clock row across the top of the board: Now in 44px numerals, Start and Serve beside it in 28px, because three 44px times do not fit a phone and Now is the one read from a metre; below it the departures, one per step: 28px time at the left, step name and a caption of dish, platform box and end time, a lamp and its word at the right. The current row sits on a pale red band and is the only black-ink row among grey ones.
FORM: Station departure board, candidate 3 of 7 on the grounded list; seed 6f2fdeab.
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance.
-->
<%== content %>
<script src="/app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
